          {
            "id": "s1:p1",
            "text": "Leptospermeae is a tribe in the plant family Myrtaceae from south-east Asia and Oceania with a main diversity center in Australia."
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p2",
            "text": "Genera\nAgonis (Australia)\nAsteromyrtus (Australia)\nHomalospermum (Australia)\nKunzea (Australia, New Zealand)\nLeptospermum\nNeofabricia (Australia)\nParagonis (Australia)\nPericalymma (Australia)\nTaxandria (Australia)"
          }
        ]
      },
